# Trident live-monitor output. High-volume machine logs — a session of 5m passes over the
# NIFTY 500 writes thousands of failure rows. The forward record (data/trident_watch.jsonl)
# is deliberately NOT ignored: that one is accumulating evidence, not run output.
data/trident_alerts.jsonl
data/trident_failures.jsonl

# Scratch: Task Scheduler before-state XML backups, one-off PDF build scripts and their PNG
# previews. output/pdf/ is deliberately NOT ignored — it holds delivered reports that exist
# nowhere else in the repo.
tmp/
